comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T04:05:33.037Z",codex-agent,"Round 1: issue read in full; searched existing tracker and no issue-specific import exists. Implement in fix/import-and-release-issues from origin/main; add behavioral revert proof and run unchanged npm and Bun release gates with isolated CI identity."
  "2026-10-18T04:09:03.582Z",codex-agent,"Legacy gh provenance now excludes copied body/label provider hints while explicit provider identities, descriptors and exporter description provenance stay authoritative. Baseline with new tests: 4/4 plain/atomic copied-body/label migrations fail. Each fixture checks native title/status/lifetime and GitHub ownership on retry; six external-owner controls preserve their owner."
  "2026-10-18T04:09:51.096Z",codex-agent,"Isolated revert proof: restore only import-fidelity.ts to origin/main with new tests unchanged; all 4/4 copied-body/label migration tests fail on stale native title. Restore the fix: combined real-tracker acceptance passes 23/23 (10 legacy ownership/control cases plus 13 closeout cases), zero skips."
  "2026-10-18T04:57:07.381Z",codex-agent,"Issue #143: 10/10 real-SDK legacy/control fixtures pass; reverting only import-fidelity.ts fails all 4/4 migration cases. Both full CI release commands PASS at 956ae58201a9058f19fab2ca6e265b7426374639: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 824/824, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across 14 authored modules. Isolated HOME and global/system Git identity were enforced. Receipts: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39098074518/job/117588542763 and https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39098074518/job/117588542909 . Remove the temporary validation workflow; implementation/tests remain unchanged. Regenerate the changelog after ALL final tracker writes. Item remains in progress and unclaimed for orchestrator verification."
